	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Non queror, quod ad me minime rescribas, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>sed nuncio me iamdudum nullas tuas accepisse <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>et boni consulo, seu non potueris seu no<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>lueris seu perierint; cur enim ita non facerem <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>cum meo <persName ref="p495">Bullingero</persName>?</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Nunc scribo, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>ut significem me valere gratia dei <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>et vivum adhuc esse; quaesivit enim me <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>sanctissimus vicarius diaboli per suos em<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>missarios postridie kalendas martii, quum essem <lb xml:id="p1z10"/><placeName ref="l1293">Nirtingae</placeName>, et parum abfuit, quin me mar<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>tyrem fecerit.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Solitus eram ambulare <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>mane paulo ante prandium iuxta <placeName ref="l2847">Necarum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>usque ad certum locum, ita ut etiam in <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>sylvam penetrarem.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Illic ergo erant, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>qui eo die me expectarunt tres; <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>non penetravi eo die et domum <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>veni nihil suspicans etiam mali.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Postri<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>die venit dux; rescivit rem totam <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ac confestim ablegavit me <placeName ref="l496">Stutgardiam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>veluti in tutiorem locum totius ducatus.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Sic res est.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">An non pudet belluam illam <lb xml:id="p1z22"/><placeName>Tyberinam</placeName> solitum calcare pede collum <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Caesarum prae se ferre, se timere a masca<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>(?) quadam.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Proh pudor.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Tu illum mone <persName ref="p495">H[enri<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>ce] Bullingere</persName>, qui illi es carissimus, ne sic se <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>gerat.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">At si ego evasi, nost in <persName>Io<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>annis <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Morelii</persName> <placeName ref="l875">Hispani</placeName>, ministri ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p1z29"/><placeName ref="l832">Gallorum</placeName> <placeName ref="l157">Frankfordiae</placeName>, <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>viri optimi et sanctissimi.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Is cum socio <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>vitae veneno fuit illic sublatus, o qualem <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>virum sustulerunt, quantum pietate.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Sic in<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>quam res est.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Credo suspicatam esse bes<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>tiam me ad comitia iturum, ubi me <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>nolet videre.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Sed sum tamen illic et <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>in vita, nimirum scriptis consiliisque.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/>Magnum aliquod bonum spero, quum videa<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>m eum diabolum ita ardere rabie, praesenti<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>t ipse suum interitum.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Iam quod ad <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>negotium, astutia magna aguntur, aliud <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>proponitur, aliud iubent vulgari.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Audis <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>hoc: coniuratio facta videtur inter <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>catholicos, ut appellant; qui habitat in coelis, <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>irridebit eos.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Quicquid prius scripserim, <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>primum thema fuit tantum de religione; sed <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>scio nostros ursuros pactiones <placeName ref="l1204">Patavienses</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z18"/>Nunc sunt adhuc in praeambulis.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Dux noster <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>eo rediit atque adeo cum uxore; strenue is <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>quidem resistet.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z21"/>Historia Sleidani, ut spero, prodibit in his nun<lb xml:id="p2z22"/>dinis.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Quid non egit <persName>Anthiocus</persName>, ut suppri<lb xml:id="p2z23"/>meretur; at placati videntur domini <lb xml:id="p2z24"/><placeName ref="l491">Argentinenses</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Prodibit etiam meus <placeName>Polus</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z25"/>cui puto nonnihil existimationis ademisse.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z26"/>Nunc <persName>Moronum</persName> oppugno, ut in libello videbis, <lb xml:id="p2z27"/>quem mitto, quamquam aliis manuscriptis multo <lb xml:id="p2z28"/>plura cotidie contra illum ago.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, frater <lb xml:id="p2z29"/>optime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salvere iubeo <persName ref="p7228">Svinglium</persName>, <persName ref="p1884">Lavaterum</persName>, <pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/><persName ref="p8442">Iosiam</persName> tuum, <persName ref="p8011">Gvalterum</persName> et reliquos omnes.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Iuvate <lb xml:id="p3z2"/>me vestris precibus.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Cupio ad vos ob eam causam, <lb xml:id="p3z3"/>quam scripsi, sed magis in gratiam d. ducis, <lb xml:id="p3z4"/>qui mihi metuit, quam ob aliam timeo; at ev<lb xml:id="p3z5"/>anescent nebulae <lb xml:id="p3z6"/>hae.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l496">Stutgardiae</placeName> 21. <lb xml:id="p3z7"/>martii 1555.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z8"/><persName ref="p3375">Vergerius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">[<pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>C]larissimo viro <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>[d.] <persName ref="p495">H[enrico] Bullingero</persName> <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>etc.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
